# REST Client / HTTP request examples. Use the running local demo only.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@case = CASE-EVT-20260914-0001

### Destructively reset the isolated demonstration database.
POST {{base}}/api/demo/load
Authorization: Bearer demo-simulator-local
Content-Type: application/json

{"scenario_id":"nominal"}

### Analyze. Change reference to ollama only after local-model setup.
POST {{base}}/api/cases/{{case}}/analyze
Authorization: Bearer demo-mcc-local
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"reference"}

### Inspect the returned plan hash and case version before approval.
GET {{base}}/api/cases/{{case}}
Authorization: Bearer demo-viewer-local

### Template: replace plan_hash and version with the current analysis response.
POST {{base}}/api/cases/{{case}}/approve-preparation
Authorization: Bearer demo-mcc-local
Content-Type: application/json

{"case_version":2,"plan_hash":"REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_64_CHARACTER_HASH","idempotency_key":"manual-approval-0001"}

### Revoke: releases the hold and invalidates the plan.
POST {{base}}/api/cases/{{case}}/update
Authorization: Bearer demo-simulator-local
Content-Type: application/json

{"source_sequence":2,"planning_status":"REVOKED"}

### Evidence export.
GET {{base}}/api/cases/{{case}}/export
Authorization: Bearer demo-viewer-local
